+- **notification** (ChavrusaChatNotificationService / HanlinMiniAppsNotificationService / both foreground Hosts): A versioned tagged event is durably queued in its product App Group. Mutable remote alerts use the shared service; both early application delegates handle actual local/remote foreground delivery and responses, and foreground recovery reads actual OS-delivered notifications. The live Host rechecks installation/generation and a declared Expo/NativeScript appIntent action, then persists its real result/error. No VM executes in the notification extension; OS delivery, locked storage, and surface-to-runtime cases still require actual attempt evidence. Follow-up: INT-05. Sources: [notification](../../Packages/HanlinAppExtensionsSDK/Sources/HanlinNotificationExtension/HanlinNotificationService.swift#L29), [miniAppsNotificationPrincipal](../../HanlinMiniAppsExtensions/Notification/NotificationService.swift#L4), [notificationEvent](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinNotificationEvent.swift#L6), [notificationQueue](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinNotificationInvocation.swift#L20), [notificationTarget](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinNotificationInvocation.swift#L48), [notificationHostDelegate](../../AI_HLY/Downstream/ScriptingPlatform/HanlinNotificationApplicationDelegate.swift#L11), [notificationForeground](../../AI_HLY/Downstream/ScriptingPlatform/HanlinScriptingPlatform.swift#L476), [extensionQueue](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinInvocationQueue.swift#L8), [extensionReceipts](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinInvocationDelivery.swift#L39), [extensionExecutor](../../Packages/HanlinPlatform/Sources/HanlinScriptExtensions/HanlinInvocationExecutor.swift#L20), [resumeDispatch](../../AI_HLY/Downstream/ScriptingPlatform/HanlinScriptingPlatform.swift#L2085), [nativeActionDispatch](../../AI_HLY/Downst